{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL1RoZSUyMEJhYnlzaXR0ZXJzJTIwJTI4MjAwNyUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Babysitters","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nsrNUqGXI95unRKZEu8BJ584xWn.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hKHX04i2zQrgZJdxS9UuFsgPUd7.jpg","description":"Seventeen-year-old Shirley is a good student who works as a babysitter in order to make money for college. One night Michael, a father Shirley works for, confesses he's unhappy with married life. Shirley has a crush on Michael, and seizes this moment to kiss him. Michael is so happy he presents Shirley with a big tip, which gives her an idea. Shirley plans to make extra money by setting up her teenage friends with other unhappy fathers.","releaseInfo":"2007","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.0","runtime":"88 min","cast":["John Leguizamo","Katherine Waterston","Cynthia Nixon","Andy Comeau","Denis O'Hare","Lauren Birkell","Louisa Krause","Halley Wegryn Gross"],"director":["David Ross"],"released":"2008-05-09T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"These girls mean business.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"John Leguizamo","character":"Michael Beltran","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kwYCdxTlDh9zauUCg4mp2XTCQTw.jpg"},{"name":"Katherine Waterston","character":"Shirley Lyner","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zaqbXjr5jE1DnEoyAHokUDoCKOM.jpg"},{"name":"Cynthia Nixon","character":"Gail Beltran","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sSl5zvn1R56nkbcL52JGO1BY7z0.jpg"},{"name":"Andy Comeau","character":"Jerry Tuchman","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sh3WIOz5FdWffJ6h62ohNqM3Kai.jpg"},{"name":"Denis O'Hare","character":"Stan Lyner","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zMim5sdMnyd2GFfPd9Jh59Vcog3.jpg"},{"name":"Lauren Birkell","character":"Melissa Rowan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bctYV8MDCvoiIlQ3SkHuz7UaZPW.jpg"},{"name":"Louisa Krause","character":"Brenda Woodberg","photo":"https://image.tmdb.o